kuayle — CLI for the kuayle self-hosted issue tracker
kuayle — 自托管 issue tracker kuayle 的命令行工具

## Global Flags / 全局标志

  --profile <NAME>     Profile to use (env: KUAYLE_PROFILE)
  --url <URL>          Override instance URL (env: KUAYLE_URL)
  --workspace <SLUG>   Override workspace slug (env: KUAYLE_WORKSPACE)
  --format human|json   Output format (default: auto-detect tty)
  --no-cache            Disable resolve disk cache (env: KUAYLE_NO_CACHE)

## Authentication / 认证

  kuayle auth login --token <PAT>     Login with Personal Access Token
  kuayle auth logout                   Remove stored credentials
  kuayle auth status                   Show authentication status

## Commands / 命令

  kuayle auth login
  kuayle auth logout
  kuayle auth status
  kuayle whoami
  kuayle workspaces list
  kuayle issues list
