  kuayle issues batch-delete
  kuayle issues subscribe
  kuayle issues unsubscribe
  kuayle issues history
  kuayle comments list
  kuayle comments create
  kuayle comments resolve
  kuayle comments reopen
  kuayle relations list
  kuayle relations create
  kuayle relations delete
  kuayle labels list
  kuayle labels create
